[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i481"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬真的没有来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原本待在灯塔的紬，现在究竟会在哪里呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"失去了主人的灯塔……显得格外寂寥。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家都在努力活跃气氛，想要赶走这份寂寞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是大家的脸上，还是难掩寂寞之情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久察觉到了这样的气氛，违心地埋怨了紬几句……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……还小小地哭了一会。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她比平时更为频繁地，在话里夹杂着奶子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"表现得十分开朗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了让我不用过度地顾虑她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后。"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i141"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"送别会渐渐接近尾声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这座岛上的日子，也即将划上句号。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想要被遗忘的我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终将遗忘一切的静久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不想被遗忘的紬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们三个人……和大家一起度过的夏天。"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i142"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……即将迎来终点。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i134"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那我走啦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，回去的那天我会去找你道别的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我会准备好礼物的，敬请期待哦～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，今天谢谢了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他们一人接一人地踏上归途。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i134"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你辛苦了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我才要这么说呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13779"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“也是呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里只剩下了我和静久两个人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要说的话，这也是理所当然的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我说，要不要再多待一会？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13935"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就像是……后夜祭那样的感觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，好啊。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i143"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是，我和静久在灯塔前……依偎在了一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是因为依依不舍？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是说……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在期待着灯塔的主人能够回来呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也不太清楚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是大概两者都有吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i140"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――依旧空无一人的灯塔沐浴在朝阳中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――紬大概……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――已经不会……再回到这里了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――我一定是下意识地……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――想要忘掉所有不愉快的事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――不知道神明是否真的存在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――不知道是否是神明在为我抹去记忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――但就算神明真的存在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――产生这种想法的人，终究是我自己。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――想要忘记……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――但是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――如今我已经不能再忘记了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――因为紬……甚至为我做到了那样的事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――我不想忘记她对我的讨厌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――也不能忘记我对她的喜欢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――无论发生什么，我都不会想要忘记。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――绝对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――绝对不会……再忘记了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――我……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――无论多么痛苦的事，都要去克服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……我们差不多，该走了吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，走吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把静久送去了渡轮码头。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说起来，最近都没有看到那只三花猫了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“它去哪儿了呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"它好像真的很关心静久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还想把静久和母亲有希望和好的消息告诉它呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还有……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久在那之后……好像就没有再失去记忆了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猫神大人到底是怎么了？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……说到底。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"它究竟是在什么时候带走了记忆呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是在睡觉的时候？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"许愿的时候？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来到岛上的时候？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉这些都不是正确答案。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……好让人捉摸不透啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真是个有够自由的神明啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话说回来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“让她忘掉记忆的，真的会是神明的吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]